<p>
  The board is a <code>Y.Array</code> named <code>cards</code>, and each card is
  a <code>Y.Map</code> with an id, its text, and its column. Adding a card
  pushes a map onto the array and deleting one removes it. Moving a card writes
  only its <code>column</code> key, so two people can drag different cards at
  the same time without a conflict. If both of you move the same card, the
  last write wins. Drag cards by the handle on their left edge.
</p>
